    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d752">

                <pb facs="0899" n="755" xml:id="pg755"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.711/13: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-02-19T16:00:00-05:00">February 19, 1929—4
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>69. Your 109, February 13, 7 p.m. Department would be interested to have any
                    further information concerning the matter and desires that you consult with Fox
                    with a view to making such representations as may seem wise and necessary.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
